      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Diamond Invisalign Provider In Dublin and Tracy, CA"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Diamond Invisalign Provider in Dublin and Tracy, CA, Serving Dublin, Pleasanton, San Ramon, Danville, Livermore, Castro Valley, Tracy, San Leandro, Hayward and Fremont, CA"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Transform Your Smile with Invisalign: A Guide to Clear Aligners"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Straight teeth are more than just a beauty goal. They help with chewing, speaking, and even oral hygiene. But many patients, especially teens, hesitate to get traditional metal braces because of how they look and feel."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "At Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, we offer a better way to straighten your teeth: Invisalign braces. Our customized aligners fit correctly and are made of clear plastic, so they’re nearly invisible. Invisalign treatment for teens and adults is one of the most advanced clear aligners to fix orthodontic issues without the discomfort of brackets and wires."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "If you're a parent exploring options for your teen or you're ready to start your own Invisalign journey, we’re here to guide you."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/img/logo2.png",
      "alt": "Logo",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Want to know if you’re a candidate for braces or Invisalign?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Take Our 30-Second Quiz Now To Find Out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Take Quiz Now!",
      "links": [
        {
          "href": "invisalign-quiz.php",
          "text": "Take Quiz Now!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Why Choose Invisalign Over Traditional Braces?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Invisalign braces offer several advantages when compared to traditional braces. Here’s why many patients and parents prefer them:"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "No metal brackets or wires"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Easily remove Invisalign aligners for meals or brushing"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Fewer orthodontist visits"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Less irritation to gums and cheeks"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Clear plastic aligners are almost invisible"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Easier to clean teeth during treatment"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "What Are Invisalign Clear Aligners?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Invisalign clear aligners are removable trays made from smooth, BPA-free plastic. Each set is designed to gradually shift your teeth into their correct position. Unlike metal braces, there are no wires, brackets, or rubber bands. Instead, you wear a series of clear plastic aligners that are changed every one to two weeks as part of a customized treatment plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Invisalign aligners are created using advanced 3D digital imaging by Align Technology, showcasing innovative align technology that ensures a perfect fit. This means each aligner is made to fit your mouth exactly, providing efficient and controlled tooth movement."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/img/elite1.png",
      "alt": "Thumb",
      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "assets/img/elite2.png",
      "alt": "Thumb",
      "title": null
    },
